{"unit_id":"fuzz1og__dsh-model-capabilities#card-zh","repo":"fuzz1og/dsh-model-capabilities","commit":"75246ac46f26824f96f6a4225ab251675ae54182","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-capabilities 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型能力设置插件，在 Settings 中注册独立的“模型能力”页面，并通过同源 HTTP 路由读取和修改 llm-pi-ai 提供方设置。用户可以逐模型配置 reasoningEfforts、调整提供方默认思考强度，一键为提供方模型应用标准档位，并编辑请求头和网关兼容选项。页面还列出提供方及模型状态，保存时使用设置修订号并返回最新视图。适合需要为自定义模型网关调整推理参数和协议兼容行为的 DSH Web 用户；无需额外 API key，模型服务凭据仍由 DSH 提供方设置管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:17-19","lib/index.js:517-706","lib/client.js:867-1018"]}
{"unit_id":"fuzz1og__dsh-model-capabilities#card-en","repo":"fuzz1og/dsh-model-capabilities","commit":"75246ac46f26824f96f6a4225ab251675ae54182","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-capabilities adds a Model Capabilities page to DSH Web Settings. It edits llm-pi-ai provider reasoning tiers, default effort, request headers, and gateway compatibility options through same-origin routes. DSH web users can tune custom model gateways; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:17-19","lib/index.js:517-706","lib/client.js:867-1018"]}
