{"unit_id":"fuzz1og__dsh-model-capabilities#feature-model-efforts","repo":"fuzz1og/dsh-model-capabilities","commit":"75246ac46f26824f96f6a4225ab251675ae54182","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-capabilities 的功能「逐模型思考档位」：为提供方中的每个模型设置未设置、禁用、标准档位或自定义 reasoningEfforts；保存时仅写入对应模型的思考档位字段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:510-850","lib/index.js:608-637"]}
