{"unit_id":"fuzz1og__dsh-model-capabilities#feature-headers-compat","repo":"fuzz1og/dsh-model-capabilities","commit":"75246ac46f26824f96f6a4225ab251675ae54182","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-capabilities 的功能「请求头与兼容选项」：在提供方页面编辑静态请求头和网关 compat 参数；应用前校验输入，并在保存后显示状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:720-850","lib/index.js:642-677"]}
{"unit_id":"fuzz1og__dsh-model-capabilities#caveat-caveat","repo":"fuzz1og/dsh-model-capabilities","commit":"75246ac46f26824f96f6a4225ab251675ae54182","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-capabilities 的请求头按提供方静态保存，值会随模型请求使用；插件禁止在此设置 user-agent。配置前应确认目标网关接受自定义头及 compat 参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:642-667"]}
